OL,5,Agrowing
OL,6,
OL,7,FBig, noisy and coming to a town near
OL,8,Fyou - why the data centre backlash is
OL,9,Fgrowing
OL,11,FUntil a few years ago many of us may
OL,12,Fhave been blissfully unaware of what a
OL,13,Fdata centre was.
OL,15,FThese giant, warehouse-like buildings
OL,16,Fpower virtually all our internet
OL,17,Factivity, from our web searches and
OL,18,Femails to movie downloads and online
OL,19,Fbanking.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
