OL,3,AMacklemore begins Free Palestine tour
OL,4,Aafter Ed Sheeran fallout
OL,5,
OL,6,FMacklemore has begun his Free Palestine
OL,7,Ftour in Dublin after Ed Sheeran's
OL,8,Fcontroversial decision to drop the
OL,9,Frapper from his tour last month.
OL,11,FThe American star played to a crowd of
OL,12,Fup to 13,000 at the city's 3Arena,
OL,13,Fhaving promised "many incredible
OL,14,Fsurprise guests" on the bill for the
OL,15,Fsold-out show.
OL,17,FThe artist, whose real name is Benjamin
OL,18,FHaggerty, announced the tour days after
OL,19,Fbeing dropped from Sheeran's Loop Tour
OL,20,Fafter making pro-Palestinian comments
OL,21,Fonstage.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
